                    AIRCRAFT RISK ANALYSIS BETWEEN 2018 to 2022
Business understanding 

    Future business expansion of aircraft as a blue print for both commercial and private enterprise, in order to achieve this considering number of factors to be considered for example type of aircraft and  potential risks over time

    A company is expanding into aviation operation require expertise informed decision that guided by evidence based in relation to aircraft safety risks.

General objective
    To determining aircraft type with lowest risk of operation for commercial and private company

Specific objectives

   1.  To Identify aircraft_type with lowest and highest cases of fatalities
   2.  To establish aircraft type with damage level
   3.  To establish month with lowest and highest fatalities
   4.  To establish location with lowest and highest fatalities
  
Data understanding
    Data from Flight aviation was provided in ms Excel formatfor manipulation.It was only source that was provided with two thousand five hundred (2,500) rows and eight (8) columns.from first impression three(3) columns had missing values.
    

Data Preparation
    Exploration of these data include loading and cleaning and analysis using statistical measures like measures of central tendancy, quality verification which help in deducing insight for informed recommendation and decison making.

    Original columns was nameed was named in away that can not be comrehended easily by all stakeholder, therefore I manage to rename columns to name that anybody can understand.

    Key cleaning steps performed:
        Converted accident dates to proper datetime format
        Extracted year, month, day of week
        Handled missing values (NaT, nulls)
        Standardized location and operator names
        Prepared fields for time-series and geographic analysis

Data Analysis (3 findings)
    Data was analyzed using pandas methods and functions, it was important to note that columns have increase from eight to twelve this happen because splitting of accident date into years, month and days of the week these will helping in pinpoiting specific time for easy grouping  


